  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Once activated by a Gu Master, a formless stare gains attacking power and can directly attack an opponent’s soul once eye contact is made. It is rank five and an attack Gu, not an investigative method. Ordinary eyes risk blindness under it; only by using two Golden Eye Gu and turning one’s own eyes into golden eyes can it be used safely.",
        "chapters": [
          379
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_master",
          "sys_attack_gu",
          "gu_golden_eye_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In Tie Mu Bai’s purple crystal primeval sea it appears as an eyeball that gives off a golden light at times. Tie Mu Bai hid it even in the battle against Ku Mo and Wu Gui; once used it would become a contest of souls that decides the victor, a trump card for the end. Tie Mu Bai had strengthened his soul’s foundation with many Gu, while Fang Yuan walked strength path without that soul work; a second of eye contact with this Gu would destroy Fang Yuan’s soul completely. Fang Yuan excavates the Gu with Tie Mu Bai’s other worms and keeps it in his aperture.",
        "chapters": [
          379
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "hidden-trump-card",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_tie_mu_bai",
          "char_ku_mo",
          "char_wu_gui",
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He leaves vajra stare Gu in Hu Immortal blessed land with other Gu he cannot use at the time, including Turn Gold Gu, Pitch Black Gu, blood skull Gu, Bone Flesh Unity Gu, and Yin Yang Rotation Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          504
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "left-in-hu-immortal-blessed-land",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
